@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Pages/NotFound.razor      URL: /not-found
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Web App template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: Shown for addresses that match no page. Routes.razor names it as the router's NotFoundPage, and
   Program.cs re-executes 404 responses to /not-found so even non-Blazor 404s look like the site.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

<h3>Not Found</h3>
<p>Sorry, the content you are looking for does not exist.</p>